= Hello, Mosaic

This file is a placeholder so the project layout is exercisable
once the parser lands in MVP 0. See `manifest.md` §2 for the syntax
this is sketching toward.

The renderer now supports PDF WinAnsi text: café culture, the
§1 legal citation, German Straße addresses, ¶ pilcrows, ©
copyright marks, and curly "smart" quotes all render at their
correct advance widths. Outside WinAnsi (Cyrillic, CJK, Greek)
still substitutes with `?` and warns until font embedding lands.
